<title>UK: Deutsche Schiffsbank sets 150 mln Dem step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Schiffsbank sets 150 mln Dem step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Sal Oppenheim and SGZ Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE SCHIFFSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN DEM   COUPON   * 4.0	 MATURITY  * 30.JUL.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.95    PAY DATE  S-30.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    BREMEN    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p>NOTES * CALL AT PAR ON 30.JUL.97, WHEN COUPON STEPS UP TO 5 PCT</p>
<p>	   S SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 1	   MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC   1.75</p>
<p> NOTES	FULLY BACKED BY PUBLIC LOANS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
